ÿóSend emegency message to all players: /EMSG 'message'
Send system message to all players:     /SMSG 'message'
Receive server time:                               /TIME
Get position of a player:                         /WHEREIS 'name'
Approach player:                                    /APPROACH 'name'
Summon a player to you:                       /SUMMON 'name'
Kick a player out of the game:               /BOOT 'name'
Summon NPC to you:                             /SUMMONNPC 'npc index'
